Mechanical engineering and machine design — useful mechanisms and continuing service (@mechanical-engineering: 0, is #chapter, #mechanical-engineering "foundations/Read-machines-and-mechanical-design-from-zero.lingua#r_61PQRJWBQXW4MHY2TC3H7HH4WG") { r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R
Begin with a familiar machine and learn to explain what it does, what its parts constrain, how loads pass through it and what evidence supports an engineering claim. [Read machines and mechanical design from zero](foundations/Read-machines-and-mechanical-design-from-zero.lingua#r_61PQRJWBQXW4MHY2TC3H7HH4WG) starts from ordinary observations and quantities, then introduces the mathematical and physical tools when they become useful.

The opening section develops quantities and English–Portuguese vocabulary, parts and interfaces, drawings, dimensions, models, coordinates, forces, free-body diagrams, moments, equivalent loads, equilibrium, constraints, members, centroids, internal actions, friction and area properties. [An inspectable beam reaction and section account](computation/An-inspectable-beam-reaction-and-section-account.lingua#r_3ST3WWAE3FMTEGFBA2B2T57GHF) makes a reaction/section account inspectable. [Defend the static model of a machine](study/Defend-the-static-model-of-a-machine.lingua#r_3ESKMC4WAANDZ5S8HK9M7TA8Q4) joins the work in a substantial investigation.

Six shared quantitative Records, one shared dimensional-metrology Record and four shared metallurgy Records retain their original continuations while participating in this route. The learning connections use #mechanical-engineering; other source and contextual references remain available without joining the selected sequence.

The dynamics section begins at [Describe motion before predicting its causes](dynamics/Describe-motion-before-predicting-its-causes.lingua#r_3Q1N06EMG3MPWM99KQN8G4TVM8), develops motion, calculus, momentum, rotation, energy, constraints, Lagrange equations and stability, then proceeds through free/forced vibration, isolation, coupled modes, rotating machinery, distributed vibration and nonlinear behavior. [An inspectable oscillator response and energy account](computation/An-inspectable-oscillator-response-and-energy-account.lingua#r_0S7WXXT95F193YPM09Z39GMKPJ) exposes both the numerical update and its energy account. Mathematical preparation is linked at the relevant steps.

After [Observe motion and identify a model that can be tested](dynamics/Observe-motion-and-identify-a-model-that-can-be-tested.lingua#r_767FAPF401T72FHQ90MFZJ4J6W), the route branches into [Advanced study of a coupled cart and pendulum](study/Advanced-study-of-a-coupled-cart-and-pendulum.lingua#r_49E3RX6SDTHP2T2NNWV07MFA7W), [Advanced study of a rotating machine and its supports](study/Advanced-study-of-a-rotating-machine-and-its-supports.lingua#r_7HA4E51ZKV0RJP9WAV7CTAPSNM) and [Advanced study of Hamiltonian mechanics and model structure](study/Advanced-study-of-Hamiltonian-mechanics-and-model-structure.lingua#r_7F5BNHT2V3P681GYWYPCZXR2CQ), joining at [Defend a dynamic model from observation to advanced analysis](study/Defend-a-dynamic-model-from-observation-to-advanced-analysis.lingua#r_7ZWJSTVPC38XBNB7M8S6PSKN34). Read the complete engineering-dynamics course and progressively deepen through Tong's notes and problems.

Material and structural work begins at [From a load history to a material response](materials/From-a-load-history-to-a-material-response.lingua#r_4WFJ7XEN9RDM02YGY3S5A0YW9A). It develops test interpretation, material state, stress/strain and constitutive laws, thermal response, axial/torsional/bending structures, deflection, instability, plasticity, time-dependent behavior, material families, cracks, fatigue, contact and measurement. [An inspectable thermoelastic axial bar](computation/An-inspectable-thermoelastic-axial-bar.lingua#r_5ADP35GB2A1A5V37FEFWQB9HVB) makes thermal expansion, restraints, distributed loads and a finite-element account inspectable.

After [Verification, validation and a meaningful stress result](computation/Verification-validation-and-a-meaningful-stress-result.lingua#r_4Z0234631TP38BBV5E4CZSE6A3), three advanced studies develop [Advanced study of a thermally loaded precision structure](study/Advanced-study-of-a-thermally-loaded-precision-structure.lingua#r_329Y297RYRM63KXKS3S1164SW3), [Advanced study of component fatigue and damage tolerance](study/Advanced-study-of-component-fatigue-and-damage-tolerance.lingua#r_2AAKGM024C5C8GZ18EB2BCVPN7) and [Advanced study of material models and nonlinear structures](study/Advanced-study-of-material-models-and-nonlinear-structures.lingua#r_4ECSQ4X6CYDTGR4QFZSXJCBVGP), joining at [Defend material and structural behavior in a machine](study/Defend-material-and-structural-behavior-in-a-machine.lingua#r_2KA62MD536H6F21EG7D20715M3). The complete Roylance module collection, Bower chapters and reused metallurgy evidence sustain this depth.

Machine elements begin at [Turn a function into a mechanism and its interfaces](elements/Turn-a-function-into-a-mechanism-and-its-interfaces.lingua#r_0MTNCTSEK8Z1B3HQYEAE17YW8T): mechanisms, shafts, couplings, rolling/sliding bearings, lubrication, springs/flexures, gear trains, belts/chains, screws, joints, seals, clutches/brakes and actuators. Motion, load, stiffness, heat, clearance and maintenance are connected throughout.

After [Evidence for a component selection and its alternatives](study/Evidence-for-a-component-selection-and-its-alternatives.lingua#r_0WQRGZJAWX0CXZ9EK3KKKKV747), the route branches into [Advanced study of a transmission, shaft and bearing system](study/Advanced-study-of-a-transmission-shaft-and-bearing-system.lingua#r_73T6XM2GFFB5SCE4ECK5J1EBAD), [Advanced study of a precision mechanism and its errors](study/Advanced-study-of-a-precision-mechanism-and-its-errors.lingua#r_622HG8157EVRX1HBNJC391HZ77) and [Advanced study of joints, retained load and maintenance](study/Advanced-study-of-joints-retained-load-and-maintenance.lingua#r_3BFV1HYS3SGQ3NFS6XDM87XY92), joining at [Defend machine elements as an interacting assembly](study/Defend-machine-elements-as-an-interacting-assembly.lingua#r_6R4CPQRB4ACH3KPZZZH5N3TFTN).

Design realization begins at [Requirements describe use and evidence](design/Requirements-describe-use-and-evidence.lingua#r_1509Y6D06KQ6MS7EVFXC8ZQ4YV), through requirements, drawings, error budgets, tolerances, inspection, process selection, production variation, assembly, commissioning and continuing service. Dimensional measurement and joining reuse their existing metrology and metallurgy Records.

[Define a small horizontal measuring carriage](project/Define-a-small-horizontal-measuring-carriage.lingua#r_4HGWPM4DBAAEHVAAAPZNK93CF5) develops an original carriage design through loads, reflected inertia, compliance, a rejected positioning-error claim, manufacturing/measurement planning and [An inspectable feed-axis motion and energy account](computation/An-inspectable-feed-axis-motion-and-energy-account.lingua#r_3H4Q0D0YXSX1GJHEZ8TB7XCJHP). The construction study asks the learner to create and characterize a suitable actual mechanism, distinguishing that work from the authored conceptual example.

[Choose advanced questions from the integrated machine](study/Choose-advanced-questions-from-the-integrated-machine.lingua#r_1K3DREDB84Q51716DGFVYEMQTW) branches into production, thermal/precision and failure/service investigations, converging at [Defend an integrated machine through its service](study/Defend-an-integrated-machine-through-its-service.lingua#r_63N2NG8PE1A88PY32FVFEX15NA). The final sequence develops scholarly criticism and independent research, ending at [Completion and continuing mechanical studies](research/Completion-and-continuing-mechanical-studies.lingua#r_6SRKN6GWDTE4453PVA7T2FYGVF). Completion requires substantial reading, derivation, investigation and revision. The general formation connects to deeper specialist subjects without replacing them.

Follow [Engineering](../Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Ergon](../../../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1) and [Inquiry](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB) for connected productive knowledge. Questions about explanation, evidence and purposes continue through [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001). [Mechanical-engineering sources — complete readings and primary methods](Sources.lingua#r_06RZYPZEFNMZ6MZ690QB1WN1Z2) identifies the reading and its access conditions.

**Continue:** [Read machines and mechanical design from zero](foundations/Read-machines-and-mechanical-design-from-zero.lingua#r_61PQRJWBQXW4MHY2TC3H7HH4WG).
} r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R

